<!--
  World fragment loaded via Include src= (see index.html shell).
  Edit this file — do not paste into index.html.

  Dense wood across the northern half. Two cost tiers (world/context.md:63-73):

    scenery    <GLTFLoader> only        → one slot in the instanced pool
    harvestable + collider + script + <ResourceNode>

  <StaticSpawner> forces instanced="true" onto its templates, so each URL is ONE
  draw call however many instances — that is what makes four-figure counts
  possible. Species variety inside a spawner comes from sibling <GameObject>
  templates plus pick-strategy="random".

  Colliders are shape: precompute (a trunk capsule read from
  gameassets_handoff.json), never a *_collision.glb fetch: that keeps the
  instanced path while still giving Rapier something solid, and it is why every
  canopy tree here can be chopped.

  break-style: fall cuts the trunk at runtime — it does NOT need the
  *_stump/_top GLBs, whose visual LODs live in _intermediate/ and never ship.
-->
